Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.58,0:24:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and sunny sweets, the occasional chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.30,0:24:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a bite of the decorations and you'll be delighted
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A secret, but the girls know it {the boys won't know it liek if you get the reference}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweets are happy clothes, wouldn't you say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,(Mysterious) A pleasant flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(Special) Gentle and happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.82,0:24:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A little sweet magic's gonna make your heart skip a beat
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.08,0:24:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Caramelizing your heart kinda like having your first crush
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pastel colored macarons that make you dance with delight
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.92,0:24:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then your cheeks, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.43,0:24:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The joy spreading through your heart like souffle chiffon
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:25:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The power to make everyone become friends
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.90,0:25:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So wonderful. ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.78,0:25:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart-pounding, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.57,0:25:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A sweet tale
